{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9a415632dc5e5032","type":"text","text":"Have an extension button or toggle of how much longer the performance is going on for and have the audience able to manipulate it as well","x":105,"y":-266,"width":250,"height":204,"color":"#0c707d"},
		{"id":"0507df71b1246dbd","type":"text","text":"Clicking on the pin will cause a pop-up window listing time and publish","x":-815,"y":-332,"width":250,"height":132,"color":"#2f5a92"},
		{"id":"e6ab1e33f7f0ab4b","type":"text","text":"Have presets to keep the experience as fast as possible in a dropdown","x":-295,"y":87,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"#3c9dbe"},
		{"id":"c8ae23831686fb22","type":"text","text":"When clicking on publish it creates another pop-up asking if the performer is 100% ready to go live or not yet","x":825,"y":-65,"width":250,"height":152,"color":"#255db6"},
		{"id":"0a2a4b50ba458308","type":"text","text":"Have a large publish button at the bottom of the pop-up window for when the performer is ready to go live","x":485,"y":187,"width":250,"height":146,"color":"#799fc8"},
		{"id":"6a196b612992969d","type":"text","text":"Map page of a map with a search bar at the top for performers to find themselves.","x":-1475,"y":173,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1b355330c49d70dc","type":"text","text":"Create a pin once the user searches for the street name and selects the radius that best fits their location but not exact location.","x":-1065,"y":-62,"width":250,"height":149,"color":"#497ea7"},
		{"id":"821ccb05251f6971","type":"text","text":"Home page with the application name and toggle button of performer or audience. A short description of its uses for the performers and audience.","x":-2160,"y":-202,"width":320,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"203d53c7d47891e3","x":2040,"y":-514,"width":285,"height":177,"color":"#a32498","type":"text","text":"There will be an \"End Set\" button that once clicked will take the pin off the map and the performer's live information will stop, they will only be able to see their tip jar and performance time."},
		{"id":"69f4668a2cf761ed","x":-118,"y":-1014,"width":348,"height":160,"color":"#cf44a3","type":"text","text":"Creating a live set screen that can be navigated by the navigation menu at the bottom of the screen. This page will have the live set countdown from the time that was selected from the publishing page. "},
		{"id":"34267f3261bcf6c5","x":355,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":148,"color":"#b4189f","type":"text","text":"There will be an icon of a tip jar and the live tips that the performer is getting as their set is ongoing,"},
		{"id":"5df312220fd959c7","type":"text","text":"Make the extension button on the live set screen so that it is able to be manipulated by the performer as they are performing. It will be a button that says \"Extend 15 min.\" and each time it is pressed it will add 15 minutes to the set. This extension of time will be visually seen on the set countdown.","x":1560,"y":-920,"width":331,"height":223,"color":"#520047"},
		{"id":"055013365a070b6c","x":800,"y":-1560,"width":250,"height":212,"color":"#af64a9","type":"text","text":"Live set screen should always have a WiFi icon that indicates online or offline and a notification will occur when the app is going offline, but nothing will change in terms of use."}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e44694388f065041","fromNode":"9a415632dc5e5032","fromSide":"right","toNode":"0a2a4b50ba458308","toSide":"left","label":"Finishing and publishing to make it live"},
		{"id":"e353d02c8fa11a53","fromNode":"e6ab1e33f7f0ab4b","fromSide":"right","toNode":"9a415632dc5e5032","toSide":"left","label":"Adding time extensions"},
